# ── Device catalog (optional) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Where the app fetches conduit/v1 device profiles from. Defaults to the public
# conduit-open-standard repo on raw.githubusercontent.com, so this is optional.
# VITE_CONDUIT_DEVICES_BASE=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pop-eye/conduit-open-standard/main/exports/devices

# ── Cloud (optional) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Set BOTH to enable accounts, cloud projects and share links. With neither set,
# the app runs fully local (localStorage only) exactly as before.
# Find these in your Supabase project → Settings → API.
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key
